<title>PHILIPPINES: Interport 1996 net at 15.426 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Interport 1996 net at 15.426 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manila's Interport Resources Corp posted a 15.426 million pesos net income for 1996, the company said on Wednesday in a disclosure to the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The real estate company said its revenues amounted to 20.554 million pesos while expenses reached 5.128 million pesos last year.</p>
<p>The company did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 632 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
